 "name_en": "Advanced Ingredient Replacement for Recipes (22R)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Advanced Ingredient Replacement for Recipes (22R)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports finding recipes based on header attributes and calculated values. You can view the result list with key attributes displayed for the user, collect items for further processing, and get an analysis that supports the decision to replace an ingredient.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Recipe Analysis by Assigned Materials:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine usage of material in recipes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Export selection to Microsoft Excel (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze search result list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Decide upon ingredient replacement</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Recipe Analysis by Standard Composition of Ingredients:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine usage of pure substance in recipes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Export selection to Microsoft Excel (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze search result list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Decide upon ingredient replacement</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Recipe Analysis by Ingredients:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine usage of an ingredient in recipes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Export selection to Microsoft Excel (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze search result list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Decide upon ingredient replacement</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Find products or recipes based on calculated data that has not been stored</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Search based on direct and cumulated values</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display calculation results and object attributes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Collect and organize result items into result sets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Result analysis supports the selection of ingredients to replace</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>高级配方成分替换 (22R)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持根据抬头属性和计算值查找配方。您可以查看包含为用户显示的关键属性的结果清单、收集项目以进行进一步处理，并获取支持替换成分决策的分析。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">按已分配物料的配方分析：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">确定配方中的物料使用</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将选择内容导出到 Microsoft Excel（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析搜索结果清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">决定替换成分</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">按成分标准构成的配方分析：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">确定配方中纯物质的使用</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将选择内容导出到 Microsoft Excel（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析搜索结果清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">决定替换成分</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">按成分的配方分析：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">确定配方中的成分使用</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将选择内容导出到 Microsoft Excel（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析搜索结果清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">决定替换成分</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio47c2ee9982624d458be746b6fc8ecd69__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据尚未存储的计算数据查找产品或配方。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">基于直接和累计值搜索</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示计算结果和对象属性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">收集结果项目并将其组织到结果集中</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">结果分析支持选择要替换的成分</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
